# Ali from Cairo: "Damage that would reduce your life total to less than 1 reduces it to 1 instead." Bot1 starts at 3
# with Ali. Bot2's Lightning Bolt deals 3, which would leave 0: it leaves 1 instead, not 0 and not 2 (CR 120.3a, 614.1a).
# At exactly 1 life the floor still applies: Bot2's Ajani's Sunstriker deals its 2 combat damage and Bot1 stays at 1. The
# damage itself is dealt in full (the ruling: only the life loss is replaced), so the Sunstriker's lifelink gains Bot2 2
# (CR 120.3f, 702.15b), not the 0 life Bot1 lost.

[Life]
Bot1: 3

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Mox Ruby
Ali from Cairo
Island x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Black Lotus
Mox Ruby
Lightning Bolt
Ajani's Sunstriker
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Red)
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Ali from Cairo.Cast
? Bot1.Mana =
Bot1.Pass
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot2.Pass
Bot2.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: White)
Bot2.Hand.Ajani's Sunstriker.Cast
Bot2.Pass
Bot2.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot2.Pass
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Lightning Bolt.Cast(Bot1)
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
? Bot1.Life = 1
[T4 Bot2.DeclareAttackers]
Bot2.Attack(Ajani's Sunstriker > Bot1)
[T4 Bot2.Main2]

[Expect]
Bot1.Life = 1
Bot2.Life = 22
Bot1.Status = (absent)
